	(descr "SHOU HAN PJ-313D 3.5 mm stereo (TRS) jack, SMD, horizontal, 3 contacts with two legs each, 2 locating posts (LCSC C668608). Land pattern from the SHOU HAN PJ-313D drawing (2020-08-24): pads 1.5 x 1.75, columns A/B/C at 1.8 / 5.0 / 8.5 from the housing front, rows 9.0 outside / 5.5 inside, posts dia 1.4 at 2.5 / 8.5. A = sleeve, B = ring, C = tip (A is nearest the opening). Origin: housing front face (the plug nose sticks out 2.5 mm towards -X), on the post axis.")
